{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start from nothing, building your business empire step by step. Experience the struggle and sense of accomplishment as you overcome obstacles in the market surge and rise to become an Dominator. Design your operational strategies, capitalize on major promotional events, allocate your staff resources, and handle public relations crises. Transform your small company into a commercial empire, one step at a time! Recruit more employees and further expand your corporate scale to gradually become a true E-Commerce Tycoon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/f248ae2f3c8425102e88a6424d53d14d.avif?t=1770195456\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A legendary business simulation experience awaits you! Starting from nothing and ultimately becoming the biggest entrepreneur, every challenge lets you feel the passion and achievement of entrepreneurship. Hire employees, expand your office, partner with express companies, run ads, acquire new properties, surpass competitors, boost your brand visibility, and increase revenue. Every choice you make paves the way for your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/284a51283ee5a826e31cb1a8e6f620a9.poster.avif?t=1770195456\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/284a51283ee5a826e31cb1a8e6f620a9.webm?t=1770195456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/284a51283ee5a826e31cb1a8e6f620a9.mp4?t=1770195456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/cc330bbebf91626227f9b3a4dc15ab75.avif?t=1770195456\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capitalizing on market trends is the key to success! Various holidays are crucial promotion nodes. Make good use of your marketing tools to build your company's reputation, attracting a continuous stream of traffic and orders. Deploy diverse marketing strategies and demonstrate your foresight to ensure your sales figures climb steadily! Unexpected situations will test your responsiveness: sudden interviews and &quot;strange&quot; requests can all become turning points for your company's public image. Handle them cleverly\u2014business reputation is the golden badge that attracts customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/cac14c705f32a055b01c8acc4cc06538.poster.avif?t=1770195456\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/cac14c705f32a055b01c8acc4cc06538.webm?t=1770195456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/cac14c705f32a055b01c8acc4cc06538.mp4?t=1770195456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/340a38dbbe57a87b091a8c03c1a6cb93.avif?t=1770195456\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rationally plan your company's office environment to make employees feel like the office is a home. Here, space is not just decoration\u2014it's a source of productivity. You can freely design the office layout. Don't neglect the construction of a lounge area. A positive work atmosphere boosts work efficiency, while a poor environment will only lower employee morale. Mr. Boss, you wouldn't want everyone to go on strike, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/6ba682f26c9bc69db8847edd78968bbf.poster.avif?t=1770195456\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/6ba682f26c9bc69db8847edd78968bbf.webm?t=1770195456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/6ba682f26c9bc69db8847edd78968bbf.mp4?t=1770195456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/extras/ff2beafd577ad0f40fab8e26570499f1.avif?t=1770195456\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team is the boss's most crucial asset! Even with billions of orders in your hand, you can't move an inch without the support of capable assistants. As the saying goes, &quot;If you can't manage a team, you'll work yourself to death.&quot; Employees are not just thoughtless &quot;tools.&quot; Employee satisfaction directly impacts work efficiency and creative output. There is strength in numbers\u2014use your management wisdom to lead your team toward the peak of performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871960/